 the end of a turn, just as the emergency evacuation countdown reached zero, would cause the game to freeze. The evacuation event and results screen will now appear simultaneously without causing the game to freeze.Our game is still being","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:56:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035917","verified_at":"2026-10-23T14:29:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4875750-1847286114028620","game_id":"steam-4875750","kind":"announcement","title":"Bug Fixes & Optimizations","summary":"Hello survivors!To provide everyone with a better gaming experience, we have made some bug fixes and optimizations in this update. Here are the details:Optimized the option in the settings interface for quickly switching between top-down view/straight-on viewOptimized the display of effect landing points when using buff/debuff itemsFixed an issue where survivor cards could cover the healing animation when hovering over them during medical item use in exploration.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:06:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028620","verified_at":"2026-10-21T13:48:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4875750-1846651706694542","game_id":"steam-4875750","kind":"announcement","title":"【V0.6.23】Bug Fixes & Improvements","summary":"Hello, Survivors!To deliver a better gameplay experience, we've fixed a number of bugs in this update. Here are the details:Fixed the configured values for fitness equipmentImproved Dale's talent textFixed the missing animation for the exercise icon when Bill and John trainFixed an issue where text in the compendium's search box couldn't be deleted when using keyboard and mouseFixed invalid key prompts appearing during encounter eventsFixed invalid key prompts appearing during in-game exploratio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:58:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694542","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4875750-1846651706693390","game_id":"steam-4875750","kind":"announcement","title":"Escape form Doomstown New Demo OUT NOW!","summary":"Hello, survivors!Escape form Doomstown is now part of Steam Next Fest this October! A brand-new free playable demo is also live—welcome to check it out!In this version, we've optimized game mechanics, UI display, and resource loops, and added new explorable areas, survivors, enemies, items, equipment, and more. We hope this brings survivors a better game experience.Here's what's playable in this demo:Added the \"Old Town & Metro Network\" area. There are now three areas to explore.A new survivor, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:15:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693390","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4875750-1842846814439956","game_id":"steam-4875750","kind":"announcement","title":"Straight View & Crafting System Overhaul","summary":"Hello, Survivors,In this update, we've added a Straight View as an optional setting, along with various gameplay optimizations and adjustments. Here are the details:UpdatesAdded \"Straight View\" as an optional setting;Added a brightness adjustment feature;Added two new craftable consumable items — one for resetting character training points, and one for summoning a merchant outside of runs;Redesigned the crafting system: removed codex items — new recipes are now unlocked automatically by upgradin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T10:43:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814439956","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4875750-1842212951302806","game_id":"steam-4875750","kind":"update","title":"【V0.5.43】Optimization Update & Bug Fixes","summary":"Dear survivors,We have fixed some bugs and optimized item values and the UI in this update, hoping to bring you a better gaming experience. Here are the details:Bug FixesFixed an issue where some medicines could not cure Buffs.OptimizationsOptimized the unclear font display in the UI.Optimized the camera shake settings — the camera no longer follows mouse movement by default.Optimized the decomposition and output values of some items for a smoother overall experience.Our game is still being cont","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T11:01:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951302806","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4875750-1842212951298716","game_id":"steam-4875750","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Playtest for Escape from Doomstown Is Now Live!","summary":"Hello Survivors,We are happy to announce that the first free playtest for Escape from Doomstown is now live!Escape from Doomstown is a post-apocalyptic survival game. Lead a squad of survivors into a town crawling with danger, scavenge for supplies, take down powerful foes, and get out before the zombies close in. Build your base, recruit new teammates, and strengthen your squad. With every expedition, grow stronger, and eventually, find a way out of this doomed city.Head over to the Escape from","occurred_at":null,"pu